  "prompt": "Repaint this existing Orange SMP Halloween item as a native 16x16 vanilla Minecraft item sprite, matching the pixel density of vanilla items like the glowstone dust, honey bottle and sweet berries. Same subject: Violet glowing potion in a square glass flask with an eye-shaped seal and copper cork, transparent background. Keep the original palette, glow colours and silhouette, simplified to 16x16: clean dark outline, upper-left lighting, 2-3 shade steps per material, no noise or dithering, no letters. Drop details that cannot stay legible at 16x16. Every opaque pixel must belong to the item.",
